idate]} {:db/id "q-183771/ma-source-field/faabd3470ff71ed1594d0cf6cc92e28e3617579580b1740601e335bf33a54ce9" :answer-field/id #uuid "36af3b8d-7ebd-56b9-a4c0-8231f0ff2499" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["q-183771/ma-source-field/faabd3470ff71ed1594d0cf6cc92e28e3617579580b1740601e335bf33a54ce9/203f88d94a38bb859e78e84aea518cf34952815758cf391887040455367d62ef" "q-183771/ma-source-field/faabd3470ff71ed1594d0cf6cc92e28e3617579580b1740601e335bf33a54ce9/a1f44d584f3d5c0539cb338e6289ad49d176231f52c1da87f334282351fe2472" "q-183771/ma-source-field/faabd3470ff71ed1594d0cf6cc92e28e3617579580b1740601e335bf33a54ce9/7d512723ec7933fc53d818fe067378407b0cca1985b020babe9fcffa79cfd32b"] :answer-field/correct "q-183771/ma-source-field/faabd3470ff71ed1594d0cf6cc92e28e3617579580b1740601e335bf33a54ce9/7d512723ec7933fc53d818fe067378407b0cca1985b020babe9fcffa79cfd32b" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-183771" :question/id #uuid "40643ae6-fe96-508d-ba25-a4e8d94924cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-183771" :question/problem "Describe the set $S={…,-2,4,-8,16,-32,...}$ using a constructive definition.\n\n*Hint: Take ${a}_{1}=-2$ in the sequence that generates the elements of $S.$*\n\n$$\nS={ {{field-1}}\\,:\\,n\\in {{field-2}} }\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the elements of our set\n\n$$\n…,\\,-2,\\,4,\\,-8,\\,16,\\,-32,\\,…\n$$\n\nform a two-way infinite geometric sequence with a common ratio $r=-2:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =-2 \\\\  & =(\\frac{4}{-2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{-8}{4}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{16}{-8}) \\\\  & =⋯\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, setting  ${a}_{1}=-2,$ the $n$th term ${a}_{n}$ of our sequence for $n\\in Z$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & ={a}_{1}\\cdot {r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-2)^{n-1} \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-2)^{n}\\cdot (-2)^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{-2}{-2}\\cdot (-2)^{n} \\\\  & =(-2)^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can define our set using a constructive definition as follows:\n\n$$\nS={(-2)^{n}\\,:\\,n\\in Z}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-183771/ma-source-field/f7eda4f88152d39b8fac62d9ede53dad22117d327da44dbde799b38aeb1c953e" "q-183771/ma-source-field/faabd3470ff71ed1594d0cf6cc92e28e3617579580b1740601e335bf33a54ce9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9df722a8-2db6-5bb8-a69c-b81b33037ab2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-183771"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821/ma-source-field/bb2ccd0c952f452ed7d8e1f4aef1e1c71d67fae630f74b972c179fa32a5b709a/b2113f87c6b6bf1c28ed979a0b201698e58e7d96097115d9adad15dc8952f22c" :answer/id #uuid "b9f8dfdc-b500-5751-86f4-01761d3fc90d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-st}\\cdot {e}^{-t}b(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821/ma-source-field/bb2ccd0c952f452ed7d8e1f4aef1e1c71d67fae630f74b972c179fa32a5b709a/00bd56bdc329d845ccbd1a3876a47676803b97a93ecc2aee6f8558b0a92f0749" :answer/id #uuid "9baf7a4c-26f7-5882-8d31-8baac9a62db2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-st}\\cdot {e}^{t}b(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821/ma-source-field/bb2ccd0c952f452ed7d8e1f4aef1e1c71d67fae630f74b972c179fa32a5b709a/704d7733985fc7a6983ed411516c0a8990795e2e7d164b2db41ae5e37a262d13" :answer/id #uuid "a4797a91-e932-53a1-8507-a34bc4953f27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{st}\\cdot {e}^{-t}b(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821/ma-source-field/bb2ccd0c952f452ed7d8e1f4aef1e1c71d67fae630f74b972c179fa32a5b709a/01bab06769e694adb3a060851042973e55b2c27f612b5aa8251e45ca715e3c92" :answer/id #uuid "e8ba92dc-5d84-544f-94e3-a2162a61a0cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{st}\\cdot {e}^{t}b(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821/ma-source-field/bb2ccd0c952f452ed7d8e1f4aef1e1c71d67fae630f74b972c179fa32a5b709a" :answer-field/id #uuid "bcc0ea1a-2b46-5501-a14e-dd629afd74d4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :ans