wer/value "s>{s}_{0}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821/ma-source-field/95b97c01192e8174bb10808df0fd307400935d5a9c2e9403bf1399788d48daad" :answer-field/id #uuid "16e7cc38-5b68-54bf-9636-f8070799322e" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["q-331821/ma-source-field/95b97c01192e8174bb10808df0fd307400935d5a9c2e9403bf1399788d48daad/48b411620ed377ee9222b817c8ed23aa5c39bdb48880d81d507d29eeec3ddf84" "q-331821/ma-source-field/95b97c01192e8174bb10808df0fd307400935d5a9c2e9403bf1399788d48daad/29da04ccd83301c9db11ee3cfb3603fa0c6ba9c5c17cc77fca46a2d11ca22153" "q-331821/ma-source-field/95b97c01192e8174bb10808df0fd307400935d5a9c2e9403bf1399788d48daad/d82d724aeba3b5f859cf41443fd7885561318df4b5143d4b9c0e5b00cf33b850"] :answer-field/correct "q-331821/ma-source-field/95b97c01192e8174bb10808df0fd307400935d5a9c2e9403bf1399788d48daad/29da04ccd83301c9db11ee3cfb3603fa0c6ba9c5c17cc77fca46a2d11ca22153" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-331821" :question/id #uuid "276a712f-2260-5901-9134-cf67e08a10a4" :question/math-academy-id "q-331821" :question/problem "Consider a function $b(t)$ such that its Laplace transform is $L{b(t)}=B(s)$ for $s>{s}_{0}.$ Suppose we wish to find $L{{e}^{t}b(t)}.$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below.By definition of the Laplace transform, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{t}b(t)}&={\\int}_{0}^{\\infty}{{field-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\\\&={\\int}_{0}^{\\infty}{{field-2}}b(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\\\&={{field-3}}\\quad\\text{for }{{field-4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Starting from the definition of the Laplace transform, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{t}b(t)} & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\cdot {e}^{t}\\,b(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-(s-1)t}\\,b(t)\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, recall that $B(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\,b(t)\\,\\text{d}t,$ where $s>{s}_{0}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-(s-1)t}\\,b(t)\\,\\text{d}t=B(s-1),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\ns-1>{s}_{0}\\,⇒\\,s>{s}_{0}+1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-331821/ma-source-field/bb2ccd0c952f452ed7d8e1f4aef1e1c71d67fae630f74b972c179fa32a5b709a" "q-331821/ma-source-field/09e5b215294f855d31e7716b261bd198277968aa93fcef2ff312215f5e8f3847" "q-331821/ma-source-field/429e1679be4ef0a20d39f730bebf9eff1c00ff7e364b87571e7e4ba583d74878" "q-331821/ma-source-field/95b97c01192e8174bb10808df0fd307400935d5a9c2e9403bf1399788d48daad"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "aeb2589b-0135-5bbb-bc91-ec121ee5defd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-331821"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-334652/ma-source-field/a28b1dba291aeccfa3db2950f1d16d7d310b5001b9f88fc03bd42b4da36364c5/013c0d988ede1773f05527e22ad24771440f4c0462ff01796887296bfc0a12db" :answer/id #uuid "1eae54aa-d68b-5aa4-a6d5-b717b9cd7024" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.019" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334652/ma-source-field/a28b1dba291aeccfa3db2950f1d16d7d310b5001b9f88fc03bd42b4da36364c5/256c6a24a8398c46337464606041333977c7ade206800ea47d17abf4188d9fce" :answer/id #uuid "e21d44bf-d6cf-56e7-ab2d-c969d1ad7503" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.095" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334652/ma-source-field/a28b1dba291aeccfa3db2950f1d16d7d310b5001b9f88fc03bd42b4da36364c5/623255d4921d6dbbc60774283050e27a780e26c79dfe0298c0ba56e9145ce9c8" :answer/id #uuid "81379745-9802-53b9-8d15-28e9cac3d84d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.175" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334652/ma-source-field/a28b1dba291aeccfa3db2950f1d16d7d310b5001b9f88fc03bd42b4da36364c5/9fada88b7612c02337ec829dd89f2c6a29c9c4398a8681f279b5635642815f62" :answer/id #uuid "cd689a58-0980-592f-9f7c-d1a7648a91a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.281" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334652/ma-source-field/a28b1dba291